 "count": 77,
 "why_this_exists": "SRC-007 was registered and marked read in Milestone 1, but only its data pages and its single measured drawing were ever read. Its 77 photographs were never indexed. A crowd-sourced photo campaign was then run to answer OQ-007 and OQ-016, and returned zero usable frames for either -- while NY-18-64 shows the approach arcade squarely and NY-18-40 and NY-18-41 show the cable saddles and the masonry openings from inside the tower. The evidence was already in the register. This index exists so that no question is ever asked of the crowd before it has been asked of the sources already held.",
 "plate_numbering": "Digital ID 120491..120563 maps to plate NY-18-N where N = digital_id - 120490, confirmed against the plate number exposed on the film edge of NY-18-42, -44 and -46.",
